[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the overhead light, with the proper tool. Work with the\ntool from the side shown in the figure.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.014.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Front courtesy light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236037\">G10</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019277.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. If necessary, remove the cover (1a) and pull out the bulbs (1b)\nfrom the rod springs.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019278.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Make sure that the  overhead\nlight is not damaged.</p><p>If removed, install the bulbs in their\nseats and place the cover.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Install the overhead light.</p><p>Check the functioning of the bulbs.</p>"]]